# Pulled head-unit artifacts stay local: they are large, proprietary and
# already covered by the root ignore rules for *.apk.
#
# Keep only the index READMEs in the repository; every pulled file and every
# decompiled source tree stays out of git.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!geely-map/
!geely-map/README.md
!diminteraction/
!diminteraction/README.md
!oneos-dimservice/
!oneos-dimservice/README.md
